# Dashboard UX Overhaul

The dashboard has functional widgets but feels dense, noisy, and inconsistent. This plan addresses the major UX issues visible in the current state.

## Current Issues

![Current dashboard state](/Users/oli/.gemini/antigravity/brain/cd3aeb39-f49d-46ff-8b46-7fe5b1a237a7/full_dashboard_initial_1772478320509.png)

1. **Duplicate Module Hub header** — WidgetShell renders "MODULE HUB" AND ModuleHub renders its own "MODULE HUB" header internally
2. **Noisy stat badges** — five mono-font badges crowd the header row, competing with the greeting
3. **Command Center header tooling is heavy** — the TODAY dropdown, sync indicator, and expand icon create visual clutter
4. **Agenda takes a fixed 350px height** even when there's only 1 item — wastes space
5. **Typography mismatch** — some widget headers are 11px mono, others 10px, inconsistent tracking widths
6. **Grid spacing is tight** — `gap-4` between the two columns is fine but items within feel compressed

## Proposed Changes

### Fix Duplicate Module Hub Header

#### [MODIFY] [ModuleHub.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/dashboard/ModuleHub.tsx)

- When `isWidget` is true, **hide the internal header** — the WidgetShell already provides one
- The settings/configure button moves into the WidgetShell header area or is appended conditionally

---

### Redesign Stat Badges

#### [MODIFY] [DashboardHeader.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/dashboard/DashboardHeader.tsx)

- Make badges smaller, lighter, and less visually dominant
- Use softer pill styling with `text-[10px]` and muted backgrounds
- Reduce horizontal padding to take less space
- The greeting and date should dominate, badges are secondary glanceable info

---

### Clean Up Command Center Header

#### [MODIFY] [page.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/app/page.tsx)

- Simplify the Command Center header: reduce padding, tighten the controls
- Make the TODAY/3 DAYS/WEEK dropdown subtler (inline text vs full select element)

---

### Improve Agenda Widget Sizing

#### [MODIFY] [AgendaTimeline.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/dashboard/AgendaTimeline.tsx)

- When `isWidget`, remove the fixed `h-[350px]` and let it size naturally within the widget shell
- Clean up the footer legend to be more compact

---

### Typography & Spacing Consistency

#### [MODIFY] [WidgetShell.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/dashboard/WidgetShell.tsx)

- Ensure widget header styling is consistent: same font size, weight, tracking
- Add a slight bottom padding improvement

#### [MODIFY] [page.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/app/page.tsx)

- Small tweaks to overall grid gaps and content area padding

